    "body": "In the spec, [ReadableStreamCancel](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#readable-stream-cancel) calls [ReadableStreamClose](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#readable-stream-close), which will resolve all outstanding `read()` promises with `{ done: true, value: undefined }`.",
